        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: UFC 140: Jones vs. Machida\n- Organizations: Ultimate Fighting Championship\n- People: Jon Jones, Lyoto Machida\n- Places: Air Canada Centre, Toronto, Ontario, Canada\n- Topics: mixed martial arts\n\nFacts:\n- UFC 140: Jones vs. Machida was a mixed martial arts event held by the Ultimate Fighting Championship on December 10, 2011 at the Air Canada Centre in Toronto, Ontario, Canada.\n- In the main event of UFC 140: Jones vs. Machida, Jon Jones handed Lyoto Machida his first career submission loss.\n- Lyoto Machida was born on May 30, 1978.\n- Lyoto Machida is a Brazilian mixed martial artist who competes in the middleweight division of the Ultimate Fighting Championship.",
